// MISTAKE: the payment of March was never written, and the line of February states exactly that payment's principal over its own: both explain the statement to the cent, so the diagnostic does not guess.
base USD
use std

entity bank : lender
account checking : bank
asset condo : property

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 900_000 USD

contract mortgage with bank
  loan 120_000 USD on 2026-01-15 at 6% over 3y for condo
  monthly on 1 from checking
  from 2026-02-01
  until 2026-03-31

2026-01-15 mortgage

2026-02-01 mortgage 6_731.92 USD
2026-03-02 mortgage = 113_868.08 USD
